"Toei Animation"},{"animation":true,"id":406,"name":"Asahi Production"},{"animation":false,"id":142,"name":"Asatsu DK"}],"synopsis":{"language":null,"source":"anilist","spoiler":false,"text":"Nagisa Misumi and Honoka Yukishiro couldn't be more different. Nagisa is sporty and Honoka bookish, and while they attend the same school, they have very little in common - until one day, a shower of shooting stars brings two very unlikely visitors into their lives: Mipple and Mepple, refugees from the Garden of Light, which has been conquered by Darkness. Endowed with new and startling powers, Nagisa and Honoka become Cure Black and Cure White, magical defenders of the light - together, they are Pretty Cure.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)"},"tags":[{"name":"Henshin","rank":97,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Female Protagonist","rank":95,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Female Cast","rank":88,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban Fantasy","rank":80,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Episodic","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Swordplay","rank":79,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Kids","rank":78,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School","rank":76,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Magic","rank":73,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Superhero","rank":72,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Primarily Child Cast","rank":70,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Isekai","rank":66,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Lacrosse","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Martial Arts","rank":60,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Fairy","rank":55,"spoiler":false},{"name":"School Club","rank":53,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Tokusatsu","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Urban","rank":50,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Aliens","rank":44,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Suicide","rank":30,"spoiler":true},{"name":"Card Battle","rank":25,"spoiler":false},{"name":"Cosplay","rank":20,"spoiler":true}],"titles":{"display":"Precure","english":"Precure","native":"ふたりはプリキュア","romaji":"Futari wa Precure","synonyms":[{"language":"zh","source":"bangumi","value":"光之美少女"},{"language":null,"source":"bangumi","value":